asr-000170
00:23:59.300 --> 00:24:07.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: the DMW's National Expenditure Program for Fiscal Year 2027 is 11.616 billion.

asr-000171
00:24:07.300 --> 00:24:11.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: The budget allocated to the Office of the Secretary is 7.267 billion.

asr-000172
00:24:11.300 --> 00:24:19.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: And its attached agency, OWA, is 3.349 billion.

asr-000173
00:24:19.300 --> 00:24:25.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: The 2027 NEP is lower by 26.058 billion

asr-000174
00:24:25.300 --> 00:24:33.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: than the Department's 37.674 billion budget proposed submitted to the Department of Budget and Management.

asr-000175
00:24:33.300 --> 00:24:37.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Compared to the 2026 General Appropriations Act,

asr-000176
00:24:37.300 --> 00:24:40.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: the 2027 NEP is lower by 129 million.

asr-000177
00:24:40.300 --> 00:24:43.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: For the Office of the Secretary,

asr-000178
00:24:43.300 --> 00:24:50.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: budget decreased by 193 million while OWA increased by 64 million.

asr-000179
00:24:50.300 --> 00:24:52.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Next slide, please.

asr-000180
00:24:52.300 --> 00:25:01.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: By expense class, our personnel services is at 4.026 billion or 34% share,

asr-000181
00:25:01.300 --> 00:25:09.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: MOOE at 7.513 billion and capital outlay at 77 million.

asr-000182
00:25:10.300 --> 00:25:12.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Next slide, please.

asr-000183
00:25:12.300 --> 00:25:21.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: By cost structure, our general administrative support is 1.837 billion

asr-000184
00:25:21.300 --> 00:25:27.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: and the operations is at 8.9 billion.

asr-000185
00:25:27.300 --> 00:25:34.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: For OSEC, the budget under the GAS decreased by 88 million or 9%

asr-000186
00:25:34.300 --> 00:25:38.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: and operations also decreased by 105 million

asr-000187
00:25:38.300 --> 00:25:40.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: compared against the 2026 GAA,

asr-000188
00:25:40.300 --> 00:25:45.300
