asr-000189
00:25:45.300 --> 00:25:49.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: MWO budget and the national maritime budget.

asr-000190
00:25:49.300 --> 00:25:55.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: For OWA, budget for GAS decreased by 116 million or 11%

asr-000191
00:25:55.300 --> 00:25:59.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: while the operations increased by 179 million

asr-000192
00:25:59.300 --> 00:26:03.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: for Alagang OWA and workers auxiliary support projects.

asr-000193
00:26:03.300 --> 00:26:05.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Next slide.

asr-000194
00:26:05.300 --> 00:26:07.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: In terms of programs for OSEC,

asr-000195
00:26:07.300 --> 00:26:13.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: there's a slight budget increases in the overseas employment and welfare program,

asr-000196
00:26:13.300 --> 00:26:18.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: regulatory program, labor migration policy and international cooperation.

asr-000197
00:26:18.300 --> 00:26:24.300
DMW Undersecretary Dominique Rubia-Tutay: Meanwhile, the general administration services and NMPs budgets decreased as mentioned

asr-000198
00:26:24.300 --> 00:26:27.300
