asr-001310
01:15:15.480 --> 01:15:23.560
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Number one, swift crisis response or immediate assistance for distressed OFWs caught in crisis

asr-001311
01:15:23.560 --> 01:15:26.660
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: through the what we call Action Fund.

asr-001312
01:15:26.660 --> 01:15:32.700
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Number two, safe repatriation and reintegration for returning OFWs,

asr-001313
01:15:33.060 --> 01:15:40.240
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: especially those who come home because of abuse, calamities, illegal recruitment or human trafficking.

asr-001314
01:15:40.240 --> 01:15:48.180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Number three, healthcare and education support not only for OFWs but also for their families here in the Philippines.

asr-001315
01:15:48.540 --> 01:15:55.240
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And finally, number four, proper monitoring to ensure that foreign employers strictly comply

asr-001316
01:15:55.820 --> 01:15:56.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: with labor laws.

asr-001317
01:15:56.660 --> 01:16:01.560
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Including establishment of accessible hotlines and digital platforms

asr-001318
01:16:01.560 --> 01:16:05.520
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: where OFWs can immediately seek help in cases of abuse.

asr-001319
01:16:06.280 --> 01:16:12.200
